viewportMain: true
---

<div class="container">
  <div class="page-head">
    <h1>Privacy policy.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Cueport collects only the information needed to operate the
      site, deliver purchases, validate licenses, and respond to support
      requests. Last updated November 17, 2026.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="paper-cols">
    <section class="paper-col">
      <h2 class="paper-head">Website and email</h2>
      <p class="paper-item">If you submit a form, subscribe, or email Cueport,
        we receive the information you provide, such as your name, email
        address, message, and request details. We use it to respond to you and
        operate the service you requested.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="paper-col">
      <h2 class="paper-head">Purchases</h2>
      <p class="paper-item">Payments are handled by a third-party checkout
        provider. Cueport receives purchase records needed to deliver your
        license, provide support, and process refunds. Cueport does not receive
        or store your full payment card number.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="paper-col">
      <h2 class="paper-head">License activation</h2>
      <p class="paper-item">When Cueport validates a license, it may send the
        license key, an activation identifier, app version, and basic device or
        system information needed to confirm that the license is valid and
        within the activation limit.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="paper-col">
      <h2 class="paper-head">Your music library</h2>
      <p class="paper-item">Cueport syncs your selected music and library data
        between your devices over your local network. Cueport does not upload
        your music library to a Cueport cloud service.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="paper-col">
      <h2 class="paper-head">Service providers</h2>
      <p class="paper-item">Cueport uses service providers for site hosting,
        email, checkout, license delivery, and app distribution. They process
        information only as needed to provide those services.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="paper-col">
      <h2 class="paper-head">Contact</h2>
      <p class="paper-item">For privacy questions or requests, email
        <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
